ush North Korea to develop  more weapons North Koreans realize that  these weapons are basically the only  thing they have going for them it's kind  of a fantasy to imagine that pressure  alone is going to solve our problem  president Trump has pressured China  to convince North Korea to stop  developing nuclear weapons and he is  reportedly deeply unhappy that China is  dragging its feet gal alright thank you  chip
 

